{"text": "In the evening, the other soldiers were put back into their box. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the people went to bed, the toys began to play. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The nutcracker was turning somersaults, and the pencil was drawing on the slate. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The canary woke up and began to talk in poems. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Only the tin soldier and the dancer did not move at all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She stayed on the tip of her toe, and he stayed on his one leg. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He did not take his eyes off her even for a moment. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At midnight, the lid of the snuffbox flew open. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was no snuff inside, only a little black goblin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tin soldier, stop looking at what is not yours, said the goblin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The soldier pretended not to hear, so the goblin said, Just wait until tomorrow.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "s", "o", "l", "d", "i", "e", "r", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "b", "a", "c", "k", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", "i", "r", " ", "b", "o", "x", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "b", "e", "d", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "o", "y", "s", " ", "b", "e", "g", "a", "n", " ", "t", "o", " ", "p", "l", "a", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "n", "u", "t", "c", "r", "a", "c", "k", "e", "r", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "u", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "r", "s", "a", "u", "l", "t", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " 